   "effects": [],
   "system": {
    "description": "<p>Weapon built from mass produced black iron or carbon steel. Made from MORTAR Divine Blueprints. Sharp and robust, perfect for mass production and outfitting armies and paramilitaries.</p><p><strong>Hilt · Saber · Physique + Beast Shrine · 1 m · Black Iron · 1.5 kg</strong></p><p><strong>Profile:</strong> Chop: a Critical Opening can be used to chop through a Limb, dealing +1 Damage.</p><p>At base, all weapons deal 2 Damage (p.33).</p><p><em>Catalog note: Printed grip is Handle; recorded as a Hilt.</em></p>",
