   "img": "systems/10kswordsfoundry/assets/icons/weapon.svg",
   "effects": [],
   "system": {
    "description": "<p>Weapon mass produced by Thousand Dragons Forge, made from ancient Revolutionist blueprints, ran through a Divine Loom to fabricate it with feathersteel. Extremely light and flexible, able to be used for biting striking attacks and sudden cutting angles.</p><p><strong>Hilt · Sword · Physique or Motorics + Beast Shrine · 1 m · Feathersteel · 0.5 kg</strong></p><p><strong>Profile:</strong> Swords are some of the most common weapons in the Trichiliocosm.</p><p>At base, all weapons deal 2 Damage (p.33).</p><p><em>Catalog note: Printed grip is Handle; recorded as a Hilt.</em></p>",
