   "_id": "f39cd91453c056b3",
   "name": "MORTAR AT-CR Cudgel",
   "type": "weapon",
   "img": "systems/10kswordsfoundry/assets/icons/weapon.svg",
   "effects": [],
   "system": {
    "description": "<p>MORTAR's highest and most premium weapon line is their AT-CR line, which stands for \"Anti-Terrorism Counter Revolution.\" It is made to break the wills of revolutionaries and to counter the strength of Cultivators. The Cudgel is the most common and cheapest weapon: the majority of bodyguards wield cudgels.</p><p><strong>Haft · Bludgeon · Physique + Beast Shrine · 1 m · Petrojade · 2 kg</strong></p><p><strong>Profile:</strong> Strike: A Critical Strike can be used to hammer into armor: if the Part targeted has Soak, reduce the target's Soak by 2 instead of just 1.</p><p><strong>Mods:</strong> CONCEALABLE ✦ SMASHING</p><p>At base, all weapons deal 2 Damage (p.33).</p><p><em>Catalog note: CONCEALABLE is not defined in the manuscript; it is kept as a tag.</em></p>",
    "source": "Rules 2.1 (Red Kalpa Manuscript), p.33",
    "rarity": "common",
    "quantity": 1,
