   "img": "systems/10kswordsfoundry/assets/icons/weapon.svg",
   "effects": [],
   "system": {
    "description": "<p>MORTAR's common mass manufactured rifle line, found across the Trichiliocosm indiscriminately.</p><p><strong>Stock · Longgun · Motorics + Hand/Eye Coordination · 400 m · Gunmetal · 4 kg</strong></p><p><strong>Profile:</strong> The most dangerous weapon in modern Hingsajagra and perhaps the most common among militaries, paramilitaries, and mercenary outfits. Needs appropriate long gun bullets to shoot, and often uses magazines. Reloading replaces magazines.</p><p><strong>Mods:</strong> AUTO</p><p><strong>Rate</strong> 30 · <strong>Capacity</strong> 30</p><p>At base, all weapons deal 2 Damage (p.33).</p>",
