   "effects": [],
   "system": {
    "description": "<p>MORTAR's common mass manufactured pistol line, found across the Trichiliocosm indiscriminately.</p><p><strong>Stock · Handgun · Motorics + Hand/Eye Coordination · 30 m · Gunmetal · 1 kg</strong></p><p><strong>Profile:</strong> The most common weapon in modern Hingsajagra. Pistols, dragoons, and revolvers all fall in this category. Needs short bullets as ammo. Revolvers count by the bullet, while modern handguns work with 12 round magazines.</p><p><strong>Rate</strong> 10 · <strong>Capacity</strong> 15</p><p>At base, all weapons deal 2 Damage (p.33).</p><p><em>Catalog note: Capacity 15 is printed here; the Handgun profile says modern handguns use 12-round magazines.</em></p>",
